## Environment Variables Required for Production

```
POSTGRES_URL="your-vercel-postgres-connection-string"
GEMINI_API_KEY="your-google-gemini-api-key"
JWT_SECRET="your-super-secure-jwt-secret-min-32-chars"
```

## Setup Instructions:
1. Create free Vercel Postgres DB: vercel.com/dashboard → Storage → Create → Postgres
2. Copy POSTGRES_URL from DB connection details
3. Get GEMINI API key: ai.google.dev → Get API key
4. Generate JWT_SECRET (openssl rand -base64 32)
5. Add all to Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables (all scopes: Production, Preview, Development)
6. Redeploy: vercel --prod
